WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.570
Your friend says the freezer trick works.

2
00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.770
Your cousin says: prove it.

3
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.770
So you decide to test it at home,

4
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.190
with an adult.

5
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.470
But a test only proves
anything if it's fair.

6
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.450
What's the fairest way to
test the freezer trick?

7
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.610
In this mission, you'll sort
out the three kinds of variable,

8
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.590
and plan your test step by step.

9
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.950
You'll find out how to get
readings you can trust,

10
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.010
and why you must never
cut a glow stick open.

11
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.280
Your mission: plan a fair
test of the freezer trick.
